    "query": "what are the best business schools in maine",
    "response": "1. **University of Maine School of Business (US News & World Report, 2023)**\n\n* Public\n* Located in Orono, Maine\n* AACSB-accredited\n* Offers MBA, MSBA, and PhD programs\n* Known for its focus on sustainability, entrepreneurship, and leadership\n* Strong alumni network and career placement assistance\n\n2. **Colby College Center for Business Studies (Bloomberg Businessweek, 2023)**\n\n* Private\n* Located in Waterville, Maine\n* AACSB-accredited\n* Offers MBA, MS in Business Analytics, and undergraduate business programs\n* Known for its rigorous academic programs and experiential learning opportunities\n* Active student clubs and organizations\n\n3. **Husson University College of Business (US News & World Report, 2023)**\n\n* Private\n* Located in Bangor, Maine\n* AACSB-accredited\n* Offers MBA, MSBA, and undergraduate business programs\n* Known for its innovative curriculum and focus on applied learning\n* Strong partnerships with local businesses and organizations\n\n4. **Saint Joseph's College of Maine Harold Alfond Institute for Business (US News & World Report, 2023)**\n\n* Private\n* Located in Standish, Maine\n* AACSB-accredited\n* Offers MBA, MS in Business Innovation, and undergraduate business programs\n* Known for its experiential learning opportunities and entrepreneurship focus\n* Active student clubs and organizations\n\n5. **University of Southern Maine School of Business (US News & World Report, 2023)**\n\n* Public\n* Located in Portland, Maine\n* AACSB-accredited\n* Offers MBA, MS in Business Analytics, and undergraduate business programs\n* Known for its focus on practical skills and industry connections\n* Strong partnerships with local businesses and organizations",
